{"number":108,"name":"سُورَةُ الكَوۡثَرِ","englishName":"Al-Kawthar","englishNameTranslation":"Abundance","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":3,"hasBasmalaPrefix":false,"ayahs":[{"g":6205,"i":1,"ar":"إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","tr":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar.","tl":"Innaa a'taina kal kauthar"},{"g":6206,"i":2,"ar":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","tr":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone].","tl":"Fa salli li rabbika wanhar"},{"g":6207,"i":3,"ar":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","tr":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","tl":"Inna shani-aka huwal abtar"}]}